ing manually with proper escapes.\n\nLet me produce the Python code as a single line with explicit \\n and \\\". But we need to ensure indentation spaces are preserved. I'll write the code with spaces.\n\nI'll do:\n\ndef solve(case):\\n    threshold = case[\\\"payload\\\"][\\\"threshold\\\"]\\n    result = []\\n    for call in case[\\\"payload\\\"][\\\"calls\\\"]:\\n        if not call.get(\\\"parseable\\\", False):\\n            continue\\n        improvement = call[\\\"loss_without_call\\\"] - call[\\\"loss_with_call\\\"]\\n        normalized = improvement / call[\\\"prediction_tokens\\\"]\\n        if normalized >= threshold:\\n            result.append(call[\\\"call_id\\\"])\\n    return result\\n\n\nNow embed in JSON object.\n\nFinal output:\n\n{\"implementation\":\"def solve(case):\\n    threshold = case[\\\"payload\\\"][\\\"threshold\\\"]\\n    result = []\\n    for call in case[\\\"payload\\\"][\\\"calls\\\"]:\\n        if not call.get(\\\"parseable\\\", False):\\n            continue\\n        improvement = call[\\\"loss_without_call\\\"] - call[\\\"loss_with_call\\\"]\\n        normalized = improvement / call[\\\"prediction_tokens\\\"]\\n        if normalized >= threshold:\\n            result.append(call[\\\"call_id\\\"])\\n    return result\\n\"}\n\nCheck: There is a trailing newline after the last return. That's fine.\n\nWe also need to ensure no extra spaces.\n\nLet me verify that the JSON is valid. It should be.\n\nWe'll output exactly that."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1530,"completion_tokens":2759,"total_tokens":4289,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1408},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2629},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1408,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":122},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}